---
/* #services — what we offer beyond collection. */
---

<section id="services" class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Services</div>
  <h2>Beyond collection.</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    We work with teams at every stage: those who need data built from scratch, those who
    already have data and need it made usable, and those who need to know whether their
    African data strategy will survive a compliance review.
  </p>

  <div class="svc-grid">
    <div class="svc">
      <h3>Commissioned data collection</h3>
      <p>
        You specify languages, domains, demographics, devices, and volume. We recruit, obtain
        consent, collect, and QA — then deliver to your format.
      </p>
      <p class="svc-link"><a href="/african-data-collection-services">Explore African data collection services →</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc">
      <h3>Annotation &amp; labeling</h3>
      <p>Full-service annotation on your existing data or ours, by trained native speakers:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Transcription and time-alignment</li>
        <li>Classification and categorisation</li>
        <li>Segmentation and diarisation</li>
        <li>Entity and sentiment labeling</li>
        <li>Image and video tagging to your schema</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="svc-link"><a href="/annotation-labelling-services">Explore annotation and labelling services →</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc">
      <h3>Data strategy &amp; compliance consultancy</h3>
      <p>Advisory from a practitioner who runs collection operations daily:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Data acquisition strategy for African markets</li>
        <li>NDPA 2023 / NDPC compliance for data collection</li>
        <li>Consent framework and documentation design</li>
        <li>Vendor and dataset due diligence</li>
        <li>African language technology advisory</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="svc-link"><a href="/ai-training-data-compliance-nigeria">Explore AI training data compliance support →</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc">
      <h3>Corpus licensing</h3>
      <p>
        Ready-built datasets licensed commercially — exclusive or non-exclusive — with full
        documentation and consent audit trail.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc">
      <h3>Translation &amp; localisation</h3>
      <p>
        Professional language services across Nigerian languages, English, French, and German,
        backed by two decades of linguist-network management.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .svc-link { margin-top: 14px }

  .svc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 16px }
  .svc {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--green);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .svc p { font-size: .92rem; color: var(--slate) }
  .svc ul { margin-top: 9px; padding-left: 18px; font-size: .88rem; color: var(--slate) }
</style>
